Article 9 (Cases Eligible for Expedited Examination) (1) "Patent application prescribed by Presidential Decree" in subparagraph 2 of Article 61 of the Act means a patent application designated by the Commissioner of the Korean Intellectual Property Office, among the following patent applications: <Amended on Jun. 23, 2000; Jun. 27, 2001; Jan. 31, 2005; Sep. 28, 2006; Jun. 28, 2007; Sep. 30, 2008; Jun. 26, 2009; Jun. 28, 2013; Dec. 30, 2014; Aug. 19, 2015; Jan. 10, 2017; Apr. 24, 2018; Jul. 9, 2019; Jun. 22, 2021; Apr. 19, 2022; Nov. 1, 2022>
