ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 25924, Dec. 30, 2014>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2015.
Article 2 (Applicability to Publication in Patent Gazette for Registration)
The amended provisions of Article 19 (2) 6-2 shall also apply to patents registered before this Decree enters into force but published in the patent gazette for registration after this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 (Transitional Measures concerning Specialized Agencies for Search for Prior Art)
The specialized agencies designated under the previous provisions of Article 8-2 before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed specialized agencies for search and classification designated under the amended provisions of Article 8-2.
Article 4 (Transitional Measures concerning Depository Authorities Designated by Commissioner of the Korean Intellectual Property Office for Micro-Organisms)
The depository authorities designated by the Commissioner of the Korean Intellectual Property Office for micro-organisms under the previous provisions of Article 2 (1) before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed specialized agencies designated under the amended provisions of Article 8-4 for the storage and distribution of deposited micro-organisms.

